# Features

## New Features

- **Scroll Navigation Buttons (TUI)**
  - Vertical navigation buttons on the right side of the session view
  - **Up arrow (▲)**: Jump to previous user message progressively (1st click → prev user, 2nd click → prev prev, etc.)
  - **Down arrow (▼)**: Scroll to bottom (appears only when scrolled up)
  - Buttons are vertically centered, positioned at `top: 50%`
  - Subtle primary-tinted background with proper spacing
  - Implemented in `packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/component/scroll-to-bottom.tsx`

- **Thinking UI** (`packages/ui/src/components/session-turn.tsx`)
  - Collapsible thinking container with `/thinking` command toggle
  - Display thinking/transparency alongside model responses
  - i18n support for thinking display translations

- **Model Favorites** (`packages/app/src/components/dialog-manage-models.tsx`)
  - Star/favorite models with visual indicators
  - Sort by favorites in model selection dialog
  - Favorites persisted in local storage

- **Auto Project Path on Web Open** (`packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/web.ts`)
  - When running `opencode web [directory]`, auto-adds the directory to the project registry
  - Opens the browser directly to the project's session view — no manual path input needed

- **Google Cloud Authentication**
  - Configured Google Cloud auth for GCP-based providers
  - Required OAuth scope added

## Build & Developer Experience

- **Cross-platform Build Script** (`script/build.ts`)
  - Bypasses Vite cache to prevent stale builds
  - Platform-aware build process
  - Used to regenerate JS SDK

- **`getBinaryPath` Helper** (`packages/opencode/src/`)
  - Provides binary path resolution utility

## Bug Fixes

- **Kimi/Moonshot Provider**: Exposed actual API errors and resolved `$ref` schema conflicts
- **Context Provider**: Fixed context provider issue in `DialogManageModels`
- **Thinking UI**: Always render reasoning parts when text is present
- **Provider Transform**: Fixed provider transformation logic (`packages/opencode/src/provider/transform.ts`)

## i18n Updates

- Thinking display translations across all supported locales
- New locale additions and updates to existing translations
